    // bis (10% bénéfice N + 15% 1-8 PASS, plancher 10% PASS N) + 163
    // quatervicies (10% revenus N-1, plancher 10% PASS N-1). The same
    // cotisation can't be deducted twice. The radar computes the combined
    // ceiling. Source: BOFiP BOI-RPPM-RCM-20-20.
